The tool never invents project facts.  Apply mode adds missing canonical
sections with explicit migration-pending markers; an Agent and human reviewer
must then integrate evidence and remove those markers.  ``--layout sdd``
additionally moves a feature into the team's SDD directory structure
(01-索引/02-需求/03-架构设计/04-详细设计/05-变更/06-实现计划/07-原始需求材料)
with the team's SDD file-naming conventions, so the delivery docs stop living in two
parallel systems.
"""

